1
00:00:12,179 --> 00:00:13,179
You were here

2
00:00:15,891 --> 00:00:17,517
I needed some fresh air

3
00:00:17,643 --> 00:00:19,978
I thought
you were smoking

4
00:00:22,189 --> 00:00:23,189
I don't smoke

5
00:00:26,610 --> 00:00:27,610
That's unexpected

6
00:00:28,654 --> 00:00:30,197
Why?

7
00:00:30,322 --> 00:00:33,075
Do I look like a bad guy
who drinks and smokes?

8
00:00:34,243 --> 00:00:35,994
I just…

9
00:00:36,119 --> 00:00:37,120
You're not denying

10
00:00:42,793 --> 00:00:45,170
My grandma passed away
of lung cancer

11
00:00:45,295 --> 00:00:46,295
so I hate cigarettes

12
00:00:48,757 --> 00:00:50,384
Keep this in mind
as a boyfriend

13
00:00:55,514 --> 00:00:57,599
I felt tension between
Hyobum and you earlier

14
00:00:59,226 --> 00:01:03,230
Weren't you guys close
when in the same group?

15
00:01:03,355 --> 00:01:04,355
No

16
00:01:05,148 --> 00:01:06,525
It was just a business
relationship

17
00:01:07,985 --> 00:01:08,985
Business…

18
00:01:12,239 --> 00:01:13,615
It's the same as ours

19
00:01:16,118 --> 00:01:17,327
Why do you think so?

20
00:01:21,581 --> 00:01:22,708
I'm already
falling for you

21
00:01:26,253 --> 00:01:27,462
I haven't heard
your answer yet

22
00:01:29,715 --> 00:01:30,716
Answer for what?

23
00:01:32,759 --> 00:01:33,759
You know what I mean

24
00:01:36,305 --> 00:01:37,431
Do whatever you want

25
00:01:38,765 --> 00:01:40,517
It's your choice
to like me or not

26
00:01:45,063 --> 00:01:47,524
Let's keep up
the good work! Cheers!

27
00:01:47,649 --> 00:01:50,652
- Go for it!
- Cheers!

28
00:01:50,777 --> 00:01:52,863
Huh? Where's Soobin?

29
00:01:52,988 --> 00:01:54,406
You've always
been together

30
00:01:54,531 --> 00:01:57,284
He can't drink today
He removed his teeth
